note contract 5 abstract lines 144, 149: any predicate other than dup32 is error 28.
om2
abstract dup32 ulong ops rotr xor
holds dup32 dup16
fn dup32mk x uint to dup32
ret seal dup32 or shl ulong x 32 ulong x
end
fn main to int
d = dup32mk 5
puth open d
ret 0
end
